{"Redundant interpolation creates invalid queries - runShardSplitQuery already interpolates template variables before calling runSplitQuery, causing double interpolation that duplicates filter expressions when ad-hoc filters are used, causing query execution to fail": 0.6492012143135071, "State mutation in test mock - the mock implementation for applyTemplateVariables directly mutates the expr property of the input query object, which causes the replace operation to only succeed on the first call when the function is called multiple times with the same object": 0.18572701513767242, "The querySupportsSplitting guard for $__range queries is defeated by pre-interpolation - after applyTemplateVariables is called, $__range is replaced with a concrete value, so isQueryWithRangeVariable no longer detects it and queries containing $__range are incorrectly routed into the splitting path": 0.8969179391860962}